note right of JournalEntry
  Partida doble (invariante):
  - mínimo 2 líneas
  - suma(debit) == suma(credit)
  - cada línea: debit XOR credit > 0
  - cuentas existentes y activas
  - no se edita ni elimina: se revierte (reverse)
  - (source, sourceId) único -> idempotencia
  Así el Balance General SIEMPRE cuadra
  (Excel: diferencias de -5,519 / -31,271 / -52,137).
end note

note right of PostingRulesDomainService
  Plantillas de asiento (PCGE):
  InvoiceIssued: D 12 CxC / H 40111 IGV + H 70 Ventas
  InvoiceIssued (advance): D 12 / H 40111 + H 122 Anticipos
  ProjectCompleted: D 122 Anticipos / H 70 Ventas
  InvoicePayment: D 10 (o 107 Detracciones) / H 12
  Expense pagado: D 60/63 + D 40111 (si crédito) / H 10
  Expense pendiente: ... / H 42 Proveedores
  Expense aporte socio: ... / H 455 o 50 Capital
  FixedCostPayment: D 62/63/65 / H 10
  PayablePayment: D 42/46 / H 10
  LoanDisbursement (RECEIVED): D 10 / H 45
  LoanInstallment (RECEIVED): D 45 + D 67 Intereses / H 10
  Loan GRANTED: inverso con cuenta 16
  FundsTransfer: D 10x destino / H 10x origen
  TaxReturnPaid: D 40111 + D 4017 / H 10
  Depreciation: D 68 / H 39
end note

note right of TaxReturn
  igvPayable = max(0, outputIgv - inputIgv - carriedCredit)
  nextCarriedCredit = max(0, inputIgv + carriedCredit - outputIgv)
  incomeTaxPrepayment = ventas del mes x tasa pago a cuenta
  totalPayable = igvPayable + incomeTaxPrepayment
  outputIgv / inputIgv salen de la cuenta 40111
  del Libro Diario del período.
end note

note bottom
  The REST controllers delegate ledger, tax and fixed-asset use cases to application services.
  PostingEventHandler listens to domain events from billing, expenses, staff, treasury and
  projects (@TransactionalEventListener, BEFORE_COMMIT) and posts a balanced JournalEntry per
  event. TaxParameters (IGV 18%, detracción 12%, retención 3%, pago a cuenta) are versioned by
  effectiveFrom and exposed to billing / expenses through AccountingContextFacade.fetchTaxRatesAt().
end note
